### Lab 2.1 - Task Manager REST API
### Start it first:  ./gradlew runLab2   (or run com.vizja.swp.lab2.Application)

### List all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review lab submission",
  "description": "Check README and zip structure",
  "status": "TODO"
}

### Update a task (use an id returned by the list request)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "status": "DONE"
}

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1
}

### Validation: blank title returns 400
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   "
}

### The HTML frontend
GET http://localhost:8080/
